---
title: Preserve the answer before shortening or cleaning up
---
sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Ordered result delivery and retention
  accDescr: The driver publishes final text before immutable terminal metadata. The waiter caches the answer and normally confirms shutdown before snapshotting and delivering it. An unknown descendant tree permits delivery of the saved answer with an uncertainty warning, while state, claims and deferred finalization remain. Other shutdown failures retain state. Console limits require a durable copy. Explicit forced close can accept an unknown tree only after fresh identity checks and mandatory durable evidence.
  participant Job as Driver / job store
  participant Runner as Waiter
  participant Cache as Private run state
  participant Copy as Durable result
  participant Caller as Caller / terminal

  Note over Job: Publish final.txt before immutable turn.json
  Runner->>Job: Read terminal result
  Job-->>Runner: Answer + status + accounting
  Runner->>Cache: Cache full answer and checksum
  Runner->>Job: Stop owned processes and confirm descendants ended
  break Descendant tree is unknown
    Runner->>Copy: Save answer with confirmed=no, keep=yes
    Runner-->>Caller: Saved answer + --close KEY --force recovery command
    Note over Runner,Cache: Keep state and claims.<br/>Defer workspace snapshot.<br/>No continuation.<br/>No automatic cleanup.
  end
  break Other shutdown failure
    Runner->>Cache: Retain answer and locks, no publication
  end
  Runner->>Cache: Record dormancy
  Note over Runner,Cache: Commit worktree changes.<br/>Derive cumulative paths and diff.<br/>Scratch inventories files.<br/>Shared checkout uses protocol paths.<br/>Record missing-patch diagnostics.
  opt Output schema selected and final text parses as JSON
    Runner->>Copy: Save JSON sidecar before delivery acknowledgement
  end
  Runner->>Copy: Save complete answer + runner footer
  alt Durable copy saved
    Copy-->>Runner: Saved file path
    Runner->>Cache: Record durable-save milestone
    Runner-->>Caller: Answer, optional limits, unchanged footer + path<br/>Add quota / reroute / schema / tier / compaction metadata
  else Copy could not be written
    Copy-->>Runner: Storage error
    Runner-->>Caller: Full answer + warning + keep=yes
    Note over Runner,Cache: Keep cached answer and run.<br/>A collector requiring a copy<br/>stops before printing.
  end
  Caller-->>Runner: Console output accepted
  Runner->>Cache: Record delivery acknowledgement
  Note over Runner,Cache: Release writer lock.<br/>Keep run or attempt cleanup.<br/>A changed delivered worktree<br/>refuses close.<br/>Cleanup archives the thread.<br/>Archive failure keeps<br/>a retry receipt.
